  it evolved for 3 billion years into the  second world and the humanoid lifeforms  who lived there  began to attain godhood through a  gradual increase in power  this era saw vast advances in cultural  and scientific advancements and the old  gods became some of the most powerful  beings in existence  10 billion years later god world fell  into internal conflict between powerful  factions of gods  culminating in ragnarok the destruction  of god world  and the release of a massive wave of  energy throughout the universe  ceding worlds with the potential to  evolve gods of their own  in what became known as the third world  god world itself split into two  divergent planets  the good new genesis ruled by the wise  and powerful highfather  and the warlike dark and evil apocalypse  the fourth world emerged when these  beings attempted to attain  godhood around 30 000 years ago these  new gods and their two planets began to  wage war  of the two planets which the new gods  inhabit apocalypse and new genesis  the latter is an effective utopia while  the former is a massive  industrial city dedicated to  intergalactic war and dominance  in one origin story darkseid was born  axus son of the rulers of apocalypse  his older brother drax had attempted to  claim the omega force  itself a source of legendary power when  uxis killed dragston took it for himself  darkseid was transformed into the  craggy-faced monstrosity  he's best known as and took the throne  of apocalypse for himself  in the new 52 title relaunch darkseid  was retconned from new god royal lineage  to a lower class resident of the world  of the old gods he manipulated them into  turning on each other  and proceeded to absorb their powers as  they fell in this iteration darkseid and  the high father are brothers  forming the origins of apocalypse and  new genesis respectively  just as darkseid wasn't always a ruler  he also wasn't always the pure evil  hard-hearted god of evil we know  following his absorption of the omega  power and renaming himself darkseid  he fell in love with a scientist and  sorceress named suli  they married in secret against the  wishes of his mother queen heger  suli began to gradually tempt darkseid  toward goodness  and away from his plans of universal  domination and together the two had a  son  named calibach darkseid's mother hegre  fearing suley's positive influence over  her  son had sully poisoned darkseid became  even more hateful in his heart  and his mother forced him to marry a  woman named tiger  who gave birth to darkseid's second son  orion he sought his revenge  ordering dasar to poison hegera in  retaliation for her killing his love  and to stake his claim as ruler of  apocalypse  in the long-standing war between  apocalypse and new genesis  the two worlds achieved a temporary  peace with a novel deal  the rulers would exchange sons each  raising the other's progeny  darkseid gave up his second son orion to  be raised by the new genesis ruler  while the latter sent his son scott free  to live in apocalypse where he was  trained and tortured by darkseid's  minion  granny goodness for his part scot-free  found he had a godlike ability to escape  effectively all traps he eventually used  this ability to escape to earth with his  wife big bada becoming the hero mr  miracle  orion on the other hand became aligned  with the side of good as the greatest  protector of new genesis  and the one prophesized to defeat  darkseid still  at least one of his sons followed in  darkseid's footsteps darkseid's first  son callie back is evil  often serving as darkseid's second in  command though comic's law has made it  clear that darkseid respects his heroic  son orion  more than the sun following in his  footsteps as a new guard  dark side has a number of powers that  make him among the most formidable of dc  villains  his skills and powers include  immortality impossibly strong and  durable physiology  and rival tactical prowess and a command  over the omega effect  a form of energy that allows him to emit  omega beams  powerful energy beams that can lock onto  and never miss a target they can shift  direction in mid-air destroy planets  move faster than speedsters  and even harm the likes of superman and  that doesn't even include his omega  sanction  where an individual gets trapped in a  parade of increasingly dreadful  and hopeless artificial lives altogether  these powers make darkseid be under  formidable foe  his most devastating capability however  comes from his lifelong pursuit of the  anti-life equation  a mathematical equation that grants him  total control over all sentient life  through proving the futility  and hopelessness of life and freedom for  years he has searched the galaxies for  the legendary anti-life equation  a formula that would give him complete  control anyone who hears it is subject  to darkseid's absolute control  and it can even grant reality distorting  powers it's a long equation but its  mastery granted darkseid the ability to  attack earth  enslave billions and attempt to  reconstruct the planet as a new  apocalypse in final crisis  here's the anti-life equation in its  full glory  loneliness plus alienation plus fear  plus despair  plus self-worth divided by mockery  divided by condemnation  divided by misunderstanding times guilt  times  shame times failure times judgment n  equals y  where y equals hope and n equals folly  love equals lies life equals death  self equals dark side of course what  exactly the anti-life equation is  changes  depending on the story in jim stalin's  cosmic odyssey  the anti-life equation is said to be  part of a nearly all-powerful anti-life  being  one pushed out of this reality by dr  fate but which is beyond even dark  side's control  in grant morrison's seven soldiers  series a sort of reimagining of dc's  earlier team the seven soldiers of  victory  darkseid has discovered the anti-life  equation that allows him to control over  the 