ter is not directly named  but his image is used in parts of the  comic while trump-like phrases are  scattered throughout  darkseid enlists the joker as an agent  of chaos to get trump elected  antagonizing the populace and serving so  much division among the people that they  become pillars for his domination goals  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic book heroes and  villains are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

